# Personal fork of https://github.com/rauls-kjarners/omp.nvim, tracked here
# instead of as a submodule (no remote of its own). node_modules is
# regenerated by `npm install` and must stay out: it's 1GB+ of vendored deps.
!.omp/dev/
!.omp/dev/omp.nvim/
!.omp/dev/omp.nvim/**
.omp/dev/omp.nvim/node_modules/
.omp/dev/omp.nvim/.git/


